{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"列に並ぶのがめんどくさくて飛鳥が居たから\nジュースまあやの分買って"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ったら買ってくれたんだけどね？\nまあやがお金渡そうとしたら\nいらない！！！！って言ってきたの！！！(´º∀º｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんでね？ドヤ顔で\n｢その代わり今度お泊り行くから｣\nって言われた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずいぶんと大人になったものだっ♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日高山かずみんにライブ中\n｢まあやー！｣\nって言われて振り返ったら\n｢でら大好きー♡｣\nって名古屋弁で言われたから\n｢I don't like You｣\nって言った♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかまあやモテるみたいで\nみなみにも名古屋弁で\nキスして！って言われた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージ裏で...\nほかにもちーちゃんあみちゃん...なんだかモテモテみたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ広島、福岡、大阪、東京！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアーの合間は仕事！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の夏は嬉しいことに乃木坂てんこ盛りの夏です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもゆいいつ心配なことは..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏休みの宿題がまだ終わってないという..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ギブミータイムーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"使い方あってるのかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このコーナーはまあやが今まで勘違いしてた事、成長したことをご紹介するコーナーです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではさっそくまいりしょう！まず一つ目"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大幅と大福今まで同じ漢字だと思ってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはですね、川後ちゃんに新幹線の中でこの本のここのページの読んでみて！って言われてまあやなりに頑張って読んだつもりが沢山間違えていたのですが、中でも\n自分が今後使うのに覚えたほうがいい間違いをご紹介しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つづいてまあやの空耳アワー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは乃木どこでもご紹介あった通り\nデビュー曲ぐるぐるカーテンの\n「開いた窓」の歌詞を「未来卵」と三年間歌い続けてたって言うのもありましたね‥\nそれ以来ファンの方は聞くとこによると\nそれにしか聞こえないらしいです(´｡･Q･｡`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまいりましょう！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆が本当の歌詞！が間違えてた歌詞orそう聞こえる歌詞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生まれたままでのサビ\n☆「いくつの嘘」\n！「いくつもーの」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレッタサビ\n☆「目をそらしたのは僕だー」\n！｢目をそらしたのは僕らー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度目の青空か\n☆「なんだって出来る可能性」\n！「なんだーかできる可能性」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人はなぜ走るのか\nAメロ\n☆「だだっぴろい」\n！「ただ広い」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆「ノース サウス ウェスト イースト」\n！「のーサスペンス きす」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏のfree＆easy\nサビの\n☆｢さあストレートに｣\n！｢さあストレートティー｣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"などなど...\n今日はここまで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ中のスクリーンの歌詞みて\n(´º∀º｀)！！！ってなる\n以後気をつけます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0021.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のホテルはみなみと同じでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜たくさん話して明日の確認してぐっすり寝る夜を過ごしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし！こんな感じでブログ大丈夫かな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんLIVEに来るときは暑いから水分補給沢山して飲み物持ってきてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして手作りうちわや名前入りタオルなどなどありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最高の夏休み作ろー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仙台LIVEの興奮が覚めやらぬままそのまま名古屋公演も燃え尽きました～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0027.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"厚さ対策も含めてまあやはLIVEおでこ出しちゃった(๑́•∀•๑̀)ฅﾃﾍ-\n次は地元広島だぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族とか見に来るからなんだか変な気分"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0031.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のブログ沢山の言葉をありがとうございました！\n改めて伝えることの大切さを知りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう！\n周りの些細なことにも感謝してこれからも行きたいと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0032.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0033.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}